{"slug":"interactive-installations-for-museums","lang":"en","title":"Interactive Museum Installations & Immersive Exhibitions | Kiasa","stylesheets":["/_astro/experience-economy-interactive-installations.DDcZrwwE.css"],"bodyClass":"","meta":[{"name":"format-detection","content":"telephone=no"},{"name":"theme-color","content":"#000203"},{"name":"description","content":"Interactive exhibitions, projection mapping and digital art for museums & cultural institutions. CMS + privacy-safe analytics, with clear budget ranges and timelines."},{"property":"og:title","content":"Interactive Museum Installations & Immersive Exhibitions | Kiasa"},{"property":"og:type","content":"website"},{"property":"og:image","content":"https://www.utsubo.com/landing/interactive-installations-for-museums/ogp.png"},{"property":"og:image:width","content":"1200"},{"property":"og:image:height","content":"630"},{"property":"og:url","content":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums"},{"property":"og:description","content":"Interactive exhibitions, projection mapping and digital art for museums & cultural institutions. CMS + privacy-safe analytics, with clear budget ranges and timelines."},{"property":"og:site_name","content":"Kiasa"},{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"},{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Interactive Museum Installations & Immersive Exhibitions | Kiasa"},{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Interactive exhibitions, projection mapping and digital art for museums & cultural institutions. CMS + privacy-safe analytics, with clear budget ranges and timelines."},{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://www.utsubo.com/landing/interactive-installations-for-museums/twitter.png"},{"name":"keywords","content":"creative studio, web development, web design, webgpu, webgl, three.js, interactive installations, consulting, metaverse, Osaka, Kyoto, Japan"},{"name":"twitter:creator","content":"@utsuboco"},{"name":"twitter:site","content":"@utsuboco"}],"links":[{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"en","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums"}],"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"headline\":\"Interactive Museum Installations & Immersive Exhibitions | Kiasa\",\"description\":\"Interactive exhibitions, projection mapping and digital art for museums & cultural institutions. CMS + privacy-safe analytics, with clear budget ranges and timelines.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\"]},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\"]},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/landing/interactive-installations-for-museums/ogp.png\",\"width\":1600,\"height\":900},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"serviceType\":\"Interactive Digital Installations for Museums & Cultural Institutions\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512}},\"areaServed\":[\"Global\"],\"keywords\":[\"interactive museum installations\",\"interactive exhibition design\",\"immersive museum experience\",\"museum projection mapping\",\"digital art installation museum\",\"interactive exhibit studio\",\"museum engagement technology\",\"privacy-safe visitor analytics\",\"multilingual museum experiences\",\"Osaka interactive studio\"],\"about\":[\"interactive installations\",\"projection mapping\",\"large displays\",\"sensor-driven experiences\",\"generative content\",\"CMS\",\"analytics\",\"accessibility\",\"multilingual UX\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Interactive Museum Installations & Immersive Exhibitions | Kiasa\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-museums#faqs\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the typical investment?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Budgets vary by size, hardware, and bespoke creative. As a rough guide: single interactive stations often start around $15k–$45k; small-room / multi-zone experiences often range $45k–$120k+; flagship immersive builds can be $120k–$300k+. Ongoing CMS/analytics/support is typically $500–$3,500/month depending on SLA.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the timeline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A focused interactive station or single-zone activation can be delivered in ~4–8 weeks after approval. Larger, highly bespoke installations typically require 8–16+ weeks depending on fabrication, approvals, and onsite constraints.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can our team update content for rotating exhibitions?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A simple CMS lets you update copy, languages, media, and QR handoffs—and schedule variants by day/time/event. Brand-locked templates keep it consistent and approval-friendly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you handle accessibility and multilingual visitors?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We can design interactions with accessibility in mind: captions/subtitles, high-contrast modes, clear UI, audio options, and physical placement considerations. Multilingual (e.g., Japanese/English) support can be built into the experience and CMS.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do analytics work—and is it privacy-safe?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On-device AI estimates impressions, dwell time, and attention rate (looking/not looking). Reporting is aggregated—no facial recognition and no image storage. Optional demographic estimates are available only if your policy allows.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you operate globally?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We design and develop from Osaka and coordinate installation worldwide with local AV partners or your preferred integrator. Remote monitoring and support plans are available.\"}}]}"],"features":["contact-form","faq"],"html":"<div class=\"progressive-blur\" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n          \" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume></div><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.15625px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.15625px);\n            z-index: 2;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradien